  "description": "Learn more about how to find the perfect size here!\nShift Into Gear!\nThe 26” Kent Divide bike is designed tweens and teens to be their go-to daily ride. Equipped with ultra lightweight, rust-proof aluminum components and a versatile 8 speed drivetrain, this bike will perform and last for years. Easily adjustable to fit a wide range of riders, your young adult rider will be thrilled with their bike for years to come!\n\nLightweight Aluminum Frame\n\nLightweight Aluminum Fork\n\nAlloy Double Wall Rims\n\nAlloy Hubs\n\nStainless Steel Spokes\n\n26\" x 1.5\" Kenda Small Block Tires\n\nEasy to Use Twist Shifter\n\n8 Speed Derailleur\n\nAlloy Crank with Water Proof Bolts\n\n32T Chainring\n\nStandard Chain\n\n11-34T Cassette/Freewheel\n\nResin MTB Pedals\n\nMTB Padded Saddle\n\nAlloy Seat Post with Quick Release\n\nAlloy Handlebar\n\nPerfect Size MTB Rubber Grips\n\nAlloy A-Head Stem\n\nFront & Rear Alloy Linear Side Pull Brakes",
